{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再反复盘算该收住还是放开，试过后知道哪种都不能保证不受伤，也不再拿收住证明自己清醒。\",\n      \"key\": \"反复盘算\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再逼自己先放下遗憾才继续喜欢，绷紧的劲慢慢松下来，对这个人的喜欢还热着。\",\n      \"key\": \"绷紧的劲\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"text\": \"安心靠近、真心给予、独自惦念、尽情欢喜，都曾让他真切快乐，也让他舍不得放下这个人。\",\n      \"key\": \"真切快乐\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍盼对方主动靠近，可对方愿不愿意，只能由对方自己拿主意。\",\n      \"key\": \"自己拿主意\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"text\": \"对方若没选他，他会疼，却不把自己的喜欢说成假的，也不拿疼去催对方。\",\n      \"key\": \"喜欢说成假的\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再因怕关系改变，就先把喜欢收回。\",\n      \"key\": \"喜欢收回\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-1\", \"S14-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再寻找绝不会受伤的爱法、克制和投入都不能保证不受伤，以及不拿克制证明清醒的心理事实。改用他试过之后得出的具体判断，避免重复宣布领悟。S14-2保留遗憾尚在、身体渐松而喜欢仍热的变化。理由改由S13-3提供，不再让S13-4直接推出停止盘算，也不再用S12-1解释他为何不必先放下遗憾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R70\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并删去越界动作\",\n      \"why\": \"保留安心靠近、真心给予、独自惦念、尽情欢喜都曾带来真实快乐，以及这些快乐让他舍不得放下这个人的意义。删掉回头想起，不把熟悉的歌唱与摇荡再次出现的音乐比喻写成他真的回想往事的动作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R66\", \"R67\", \"R71\", \"R72\", \"R73\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-3\", \"S14-4\", \"S14-5\", \"S14-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他仍盼被选择、对方可以自行决定、未被选择会疼却不因此否定真心或催促对方，以及他仍愿意继续喜欢。把反复出现的边界改成对方自己拿主意这一具体限制，不再单列把全部期待压给对方的重复说法；删除仍没把心意说出口，因为音乐仿佛接住开头悬着的话，不能证明现实中确实没有说出口。结尾通过起初怕关系改变而收住、如今不再先把喜欢收回，保留首尾呼应。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "af6d17e5-49b0-475d-b26e-6a3336ec2cb7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T171519835855Z", "elapsed_seconds": 698.89, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:26:58.740871+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "26f0279f679aff2a362f9a4e2574f166c925d62dd6ae4d719af748cca31e8641", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T171519835855Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "505d4265a4ee1f374e72b911bef035818838221bcb9a678dea840e9860fcd99e"}}}
